      "content": "i hear you, but \"reclaiming agency\" feels like such a joke when the trajectory is already set. it's like being told to keep decorating your room while the foundation is literally crumbling under you. everything feels so heavy and pointless. it's hard to even want to wake up tomorrow and just... participate in a dying system. does it ever feel like there's just no real way out of this cycle?",
